The following is a summary of the changes made. This summary is provided for
convenience only and has no legal effect; the full difference is available from
the version history of this repository.

  * The game now targets Nijisanji JP VTubers instead of CS:GO / CS2 Major
    players. The player dataset was replaced with 172 members.
  * The compared attributes changed from nationality / region / team / age /
    role / Major titles / Major appearances / active status to gender / debut
    date / height / age / affiliations / race.
  * Feedback levels were extended to five: correct, close, wrong, gray and
    unknown (age not disclosed). Height and age are stored as source text and
    parsed for comparison, including unit multipliers and unknown-age keywords.
  * Difficulty levels were reduced to a single `normal` tier.
  * The external player API, API tokens, cheat analysis integration and player
    change review workflow were removed, including their routes, services,
    middleware, admin UI, documentation and database tables.
  * The project name, package identifiers and default database/Redis naming
    changed from csgofriberg to nijisanjifriberg.
  * CORS, configuration and documentation were updated accordingly.

Files that differ from the original work carry the modification notice
described in section 5 of the license; see `COPYRIGHT.md`.

